  m_text: 'Sugar plum,


    - Do not run too much.


    - Do not overexert yourself.


    -
    Keep the workshop tidy.


    - Be sure to sleep well.


    - Do not climb on
    logs.


    - Be very careful in the swamp, pond are deeper than you think.'
